\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Static panel across three rounds (140 tasks; Qwen3.8-27B for the first two column groups, Qwen3-VL-8B-Instruct for the transfer group; temperature 0.7, top-$p$ 0.8, top-$k$ 20, fixed seed). ``Target'' counts selections matching the frozen original label; $\Delta $ is the paired net change against Direct within the same run; $p$ and the exact 95\% CI come from two-sided exact McNemar tests on wrong--target discordant pairs \citep  {mcnemar1947note}, (abstentions and interface failures excluded from the test, retained in $\Delta $). Rounds cost 8.86M/8.84M/8.14M tokens on 27B, 27B, and 8B; error composition, stratification, and the development subset are in Appendix\nobreakspace  {}\ref {app:details}.\relax }}{7}{table.caption.2}\protected@file@percent }
