\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Matched-configuration replication (Appendix\nobreakspace  {}\ref {app:details}): three request seeds for Direct and \textsc  {Cers}{}, SC3 majority over the Direct seeds at no extra requests, the bounded tabular-answering baseline (two requests per task; 55 abstentions and 18 transcription failures in the denominator), and the clean-chart control. $\Delta $ and $p$ are paired against the Direct seed-12345 run (seeded arms: mean net over seeds, pooled exact McNemar over 420 paired units; the clean-chart control pairs task-level across chart variants); accuracy is the full-denominator fraction matching the frozen original label, mean $\pm $ sd over seeds.\relax }}{7}{table.caption.3}\protected@file@percent }
